{"id":"63636ebe91883deee9ad03ee","source":"guardian-rss","source_name":"The Guardian World","platform":"rss","url":"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/nov/28/victorian-election-live-results-updates-premier-ben-carroll-jess-wilson-warren-pickering-2026-victoria-polls-votes-latest-news-ntwnfb","published_at":"2026-11-28T01:16:55Z","collected_at":"2026-11-28T01:35:10.856875Z","title":"Victorian election 2026 live: voters head to the polls as Coalition seeks to topple Labor – latest news","text":"Follow live updates today and results tonight as Labor’s Ben Carroll and Liberal leader Jess Wilson seek victory in Victoria’s state election Victorian election 2026 guide: what you need to know Confused about who to vote for? Check the parties’ key promises and policies See all of our Victorian state election coverage Get our daily political email , free app or daily news podcast ‘Greens surge is coming’, Victorian leader says The Victorian Greens leader, Ellen Sandell , told ABC’s Weekend Breakfast the Greens are competitive in seats Labor has held for 99 years, showing the “Greens surge is coming” amid disaffection with Labor. What people are telling me is that they are just so dismayed and disappointed at how Labor has moved away from their traditional values. They have really followed the Liberals and One Nation down a rightwing rabbit-hole, and people are sick of that. It’s not about me. If I’m given that honour, we’re absolutely ready and I’m ready. But this is about Victorians and fixing this state. Continue reading...","html":"","media":[],"author":"Josh Taylor","language":"und","group":"international-media","perspective":"mixed","trust":"high","tags":[],"raw":{"archive_policy":"public_excerpt_v1","content_sha256":"0dd7e46b23e7cba433fbc14a1b0b3c2a4d3c1add547ead9ff0c9228ccbed68b6","original_text_chars":1042,"original_html_chars":1805,"text_truncated":false,"media_count":0,"platform":{"entry_id":"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/nov/